Error [E0121]: `p` was consumed by `consume`, so it can't be used here
  --> tests/ui/struct_use_after_move.jet:12:13
    |
 12 |     print(p.x)
    |             ^
  --> tests/ui/struct_use_after_move.jet:11:14
    |
 11 |     consume(^p)
    |              ^ `p` moved to `consume` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `p` after the move, or give `consume` a copy with `p.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
